  "details": "- CVE-2026-19774: fix stack-based buffer overflow in A2DP remote stream endpoint\n  codec capability storage and validate cached capabilities on load\n- CVE-2026-75032: fix out-of-bounds read in AVRCP GetFolderItems response parsing\n  by bounding media item and folder names to the received packet length\n- CVE-2026-80185: fix type confusion crash in SDP XML record parsing by rejecting\n  nested attributes and mismatched sequence/alternate closing elements\n- CVE-2026-80186: fix stack-based buffer overflow when parsing the remote device\n  name from EIR data\n- CVE-2026-85218: fix stack-based buffer overflows in AVRCP ListPlayerAttributes\n  response handling by validating the PDU length and clamping the attribute count",
